{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DQkkqRPDWhsZQjLV87ka2Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me verify the final checklist:\n\n- [x] Measured performance BEFORE making changes (results saved in `autoopt-results/2026-04-15-2100-precompute-mle-fold-layout/results/before_*.json`)\n- [x] Implemented the plan (pre-computed fold descriptors + fused kernel launch)\n- [x] Measured performance AFTER changes (results saved in `autoopt-results/2026-04-15-2100-precompute-mle-fold-layout/results/after_*.json`)\n- [x] `autoopt-results/2026-04-15-2100-precompute-mle-fold-layout/report.md` exists with ALL sections: Description, Implementation, Results, Assessment, Future Work\n- [x] Results table shows comparison vs BOTH baseline AND before-task\n- [x] `autoopt-results/log.md` has a new entry for this task\n- [x] Implementation committed to git: `94053a78`\n- [x] `autoopt-results/` is NOT committed or staged\n- [x] Optimization failed: committed then reverted (`8ad90269`)\n- [x] Created tag `autoopt/2026-04-15-2100-precompute-mle-fold-layout` on the revert commit\n\nAll checklist items verified. The task is complete.\n\n**Summary**: Pre-computed MLE fold descriptor arrays and fused mat+sel kernel launches into a single launch per round. The optimization eliminated 224 CUDA API calls and halved kernel launches per segment, but the total savings (~0.3-0.5ms) were 100x below the measurement noise floor. MLE Rounds at APC 300 was unchanged at 166ms. The implementation was committed and reverted since it didn't improve performance. MLE Rounds is now kernel-execution-bound; further improvements require algorithmic or kernel-level changes."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":396,"cache_read_input_tokens":125311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":396},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standa